            <ArticleTitle>[Visualization of data from statistical analysis of the parameters of somatosensory evoked potential components].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>28-9</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>A method is proposed to construct bar charts of statistical differences in the parameters of somatosensory evoked potentials, which simultaneously reflect the level of sensitization and reactivity of pathological excitation generators forming in the central nervous system in chronic pain syndromes. This approach can promote visualization and objectification of functional disorders of the central nervous system during treatment. Moreover, there may be prognosis of a degree of chronization of the pain syndrome.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
